.claude/
# The installer writes CLAUDE.md (a Claude Code -> AGENTS.md wrapper) into a
# fresh clone so the verified harness works out of the box. It's a local
# convenience, not framework content — keep it out of contributors' git status.
CLAUDE.md
domains/
domain/
adapters/logs/
# Run workspaces are bulky, ephemeral, and are themselves git repos (cannot
# be partially tracked). The scored evidence is the basis of the framework's
# empirical claims — committed state is the only real state — so the runner
# mirrors each result.json into evals/results/, which IS tracked
# (review 2026-06-12, finding 4).
evals/runs/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
domain/code-architect/
